        <!-- Calibration Config Panel -->
        <item>
         <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grp_config">
          <property name="title">
           <string>Calibration Settings &amp; Parameters</string>
          </property>
          <layout class="QGridLayout" name="grid_config">
           <item row="0" column="0">
            <widget class="QLabel" name="lbl_scan_mode">
             <property name="text">
              <string>Calibration Mode:</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="1">
            <widget class="QComboBox" name="combo_scan_mode">
             <item>
              <property name="text">
               <string>Power</string>
              </property>
             </item>
             <item>
              <property name="text">
               <string>Polarization</string>
              </property>
             </item>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="2">
            <widget class="QLabel" name="lbl_polar_search">
             <property name="text">
              <string>Polar Search Algo:</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="3">
            <widget class="QComboBox" name="combo_polar_search">
             <item>
              <property name="text">
               <string>Model Tracking (Option C)</string>
              </property>
             </item>
             <item>
              <property name="text">
               <string>Sequential Step (Option A)</string>
              </property>
             </item>
             <item>
              <property name="text">
               <string>Binary Search (Option B)</string>
              </property>
             </item>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="4">
            <widget class="QLabel" name="lbl_target_power">
             <property name="text">
              <string>Target Power (mW):</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="5">
            <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="spin_target_power">
             <property name="minimumSize">
              <size>
               <width>95</width>
               <height>0</height>
              </size>
             </property>
             <property name="decimals">
              <number>3</number>
             </property>
             <property name="maximum">
              <double>10000.000000000000000</double>
             </property>
             <property name="value">
              <double>5.000000000000000</double>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="6">
            <widget class="QLabel" name="lbl_stability_tol">
             <property name="toolTip">
              <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stability Tol: absolute value or % of the reading, whichever is larger&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The reading counts as stable when all readings in the last Stable Window (one every Refresh) lie within max(absolute, % x reading): max - min &amp;lt;= that. Used in both modes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The absolute value is the floor at low power: set it above the detector noise there. The percentage follows the power, for the laser fluctuations at high power. 0 % = absolute value only.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To measure the noise: Power mode, Stage 1 Step NO. 1 at the angle of interest, both values 0. The point never passes, and for 60 s the log shows max - min of every window.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
             </property>
             <property name="text">
              <string>Stability Tol (mW):</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="7">
            <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="layout_stability_tol">
             <property name="spacing">
              <number>4</number>
             </property>
             <item>
              <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="spin_stability_tol">
               <property name="minimumSize">
                <size>
                 <width>95</width>
                 <height>0</height>
                </size>
               </property>
               <property name="toolTip">
                <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stability Tol: absolute value or % of the reading, whichever is larger&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The reading counts as stable when all readings in the last Stable Window (one every Refresh) lie within max(absolute, % x reading): max - min &amp;lt;= that. Used in both modes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The absolute value is the floor at low power: set it above the detector noise there. The percentage follows the power, for the laser fluctuations at high power. 0 % = absolute value only.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To measure the noise: Power mode, Stage 1 Step NO. 1 at the angle of interest, both values 0. The point never passes, and for 60 s the log shows max - min of every window.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
               </property>
               <property name="decimals">
                <number>4</number>
               </property>
               <property name="maximum">
                <double>100.000000000000000</double>
               </property>
               <property name="value">
                <double>0.002000000000000</double>
               </property>
              </widget>
             </item>
             <item>
              <widget class="QLabel" name="lbl_stability_tol_or">
               <property name="toolTip">
                <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stability Tol: absolute value or % of the reading, whichever is larger&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The reading counts as stable when all readings in the last Stable Window (one every Refresh) lie within max(absolute, % x reading): max - min &amp;lt;= that. Used in both modes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The absolute value is the floor at low power: set it above the detector noise there. The percentage follows the power, for the laser fluctuations at high power. 0 % = absolute value only.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To measure the noise: Power mode, Stage 1 Step NO. 1 at the angle of interest, both values 0. The point never passes, and for 60 s the log shows max - min of every window.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
               </property>
               <property name="text">
                <string>or</string>
               </property>
              </widget>
             </item>
             <item>
              <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="spin_stability_tol_pct">
               <property name="minimumSize">
                <size>
                 <width>50</width>
                 <height>0</height>
                </size>
               </property>
               <property name="maximumSize">
                <size>
                 <width>50</width>
                 <height>16777215</height>
                </size>
               </property>
               <property name="toolTip">
                <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stability Tol: absolute value or % of the reading, whichever is larger&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The reading counts as stable when all readings in the last Stable Window (one every Refresh) lie within max(absolute, % x reading): max - min &amp;lt;= that. Used in both modes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The absolute value is the floor at low power: set it above the detector noise there. The percentage follows the power, for the laser fluctuations at high power. 0 % = absolute value only.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To measure the noise: Power mode, Stage 1 Step NO. 1 at the angle of interest, both values 0. The point never passes, and for 60 s the log shows max - min of every window.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
               </property>
               <property name="buttonSymbols">
                <enum>QAbstractSpinBox::NoButtons</enum>
               </property>
               <property name="suffix">
                <string> %</string>
               </property>
               <property name="decimals">
                <number>2</number>
               </property>
               <property name="maximum">
                <double>10.000000000000000</double>
               </property>
               <property name="singleStep">
                <double>0.100000000000000</double>
               </property>
               <property name="value">
                <double>0.500000000000000</double>
               </property>
              </widget>
             </item>
            </layout>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="8">
            <widget class="QLabel" name="lbl_target_tol">
             <property name="toolTip">
              <string>Polarization mode: a Stage 1 angle is accepted when |P - Target Power| is no more than this and the power is stable. Keep it at least the Stability Tol at the target, otherwise noise can keep a stable reading from matching. Not used in Power mode.</string>
             </property>
             <property name="text">
              <string>Target Tol (mW):</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="9">
            <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="spin_target_tol">
             <property name="minimumSize">
              <size>
               <width>95</width>
               <height>0</height>
              </size>
             </property>
             <property name="toolTip">
              <string>Polarization mode: a Stage 1 angle is accepted when |P - Target Power| is no more than this and the power is stable. Keep it at least the Stability Tol at the target, otherwise noise can keep a stable reading from matching. Not used in Power mode.</string>
             </property>
             <property name="decimals">
              <number>4</number>
             </property>
             <property name="maximum">
              <double>100.000000000000000</double>
             </property>
             <property name="value">
              <double>0.050000000000000</double>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="10">
            <widget class="QLabel" name="lbl_stable_window">
             <property name="toolTip">
              <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stable Window (s)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After each stage move the detector is read every Refresh (ms). The reading counts as stable as soon as all readings in the last Stable Window lie within Stability Tol (max - min), and their mean is recorded. Default 3 s at 500 ms = 7 readings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;While the reading still changes after the move the window does not pass, so no separate wait time is needed. A measurement that is not stable within 60 s is recorded with Stable = False and noted in the ScanLog.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lock-in: keep Stable Window at least 5 x the time constant and Refresh at least the time constant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
             </property>
             <property name="text">
              <string>Stable Window (s):</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="11">
            <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="spin_stable_window">
             <property name="minimumSize">
              <size>
               <width>70</width>
               <height>0</height>
              </size>
             </property>
             <property name="toolTip">
              <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stable Window (s)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After each stage move the detector is read every Refresh (ms). The reading counts as stable as soon as all readings in the last Stable Window lie within Stability Tol (max - min), and their mean is recorded. Default 3 s at 500 ms = 7 readings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;While the reading still changes after the move the window does not pass, so no separate wait time is needed. A measurement that is not stable within 60 s is recorded with Stable = False and noted in the ScanLog.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lock-in: keep Stable Window at least 5 x the time constant and Refresh at least the time constant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
             </property>
             <property name="decimals">
              <number>1</number>
             </property>
             <property name="minimum">
              <double>0.500000000000000</double>
             </property>
             <property name="maximum">
              <double>30.000000000000000</double>
             </property>
             <property name="singleStep">
              <double>0.500000000000000</double>
             </property>
             <property name="value">
              <double>3.000000000000000</double>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>

